 [[sym-mercy]]Mercy verdict:word[]:: Covenant loyalty — the Hebrew is _chesed_, the word beneath most of the Bible's “mercy”: the *debt canceled* for the one who __“confesseth and *forsaketh*,”__ kept __“with them that love him and *keep his commandments*,”__ and required of the pardoned — __“blessed are the merciful: for they shall *obtain* mercy.”__ +
